%% effects.mgp - gucOS MagicPoint showcase (todos/0185): %pause builds and
%% %mark/%again column layout. (The cutin fly-ins need X child windows,
%% which this port drops - see vendor/magicpoint/README.md descopes.)
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "MidnightBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 5, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Effects

builds and columns
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Builds

	each click reveals one point
%pause
	this one arrived second
%pause
	this one third
%pause
%size 4, fore "orange", center

(that is all %pause does - simple and effective)
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Two columns

%size 4, fore "white", left
%mark
%prefix 5
left column
sits here
on these lines
%again
%prefix 55
right column
via mark/again
same vertical spot
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Build + color

%size 5, center
%fore "red"
ready
%pause
%fore "gold"
steady
%pause
%fore "SpringGreen"
go
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
that is the tour - press q
